  - title: 02 / Diagnose the bearing
    explanation: Record a healthy baseline. Compare the new spectrum with bearing
      race, alignment and gear-mesh frequencies.
    caption: "BASELINE  \u2022  RMS  \u2022  FFT"
    parts:
    - id: input
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.18, y: 0.66}
      label: BASELINE
